					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
						<a href="/rent-a-golf-cart" class="bg-brand-green text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition text-center">
							Request a Rental
						</a>
						<a href="tel:3523070111" class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition text-center">
							Call (352) 307-0111
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/club-car_img_v68_250813_154125925.webp" alt="Golf cart rentals in Ocala Florida" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" width="800" height="600" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Why Rent in Ocala Section -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">Why Rent a Golf Cart in Ocala, Florida?</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
				<div class="space-y-6">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Explore Ocala's Premier Communities</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Ocala is home to some of Florida's most beautiful active adult communities and neighborhoods. Our golf cart rentals are perfect for residents and visitors exploring <strong>Ocala Palms</strong>, <strong>Golden Ocala Golf & Equestrian Club</strong>, <strong>Woodfields</strong>, <strong>Stonecrest</strong>, <strong>Rolling Greens</strong>, and <strong>On Top of The World</strong>. These communities feature extensive golf cart paths connecting homes to clubhouses, golf courses, and recreational facilities.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Access World-Class Equestrian Venues</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Ocala is known as the "Horse Capital of the World" and hosts major equestrian events throughout the year. Our golf cart rentals are ideal for navigating <strong>World Equestrian Center (WEC)</strong> in Ocala, <strong>HITS Ocala</strong> horse shows, and <strong>Florida Horse Park</strong>. We've provided fleet rentals for events at <strong>Ocala Breeders Sales</strong> and the <strong>South Eastern Livestock Pavilion</strong>, making us the trusted choice for equestrian event transportation.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Convenient Location Near Downtown Ocala</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Our dealership is strategically located at <strong>12885 S US Highway 441 in Belleview</strong>, just 8 miles south of downtown Ocala. This prime location on <strong>US Highway 441</strong> (also known as Pine Avenue) makes us easily accessible from <strong>State Road 200</strong>, <strong>I-75</strong>, and <strong>SR 40</strong>. We're directly across from the <strong>Market of Marion</strong>, making pickup convenient for Ocala residents.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/golf-cart-rentals-in-the-villages_img_v69_250813_160043497.webp" alt="Golf cart rental in Ocala neighborhoods" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg mb-6" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
