						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Serving Ocala Since 1999</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
							As a locally owned and operated business, we understand Ocala's unique needs. Our team has deep roots in Marion County and has served thousands of Ocala residents, businesses, and event organizers over the past 26 years.
						</p>
						<ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 font-semibold">
							<li>• 26+ years serving Ocala and Marion County</li>
							<li>• Locally owned and operated since 1999</li>
							<li>• Trusted by Ocala's premier communities</li>
							<li>• Preferred vendor for WEC and HITS events</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Ocala Neighborhoods Served -->
