			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">World Equestrian Center (WEC)</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-100 font-semibold mb-2">11000 NW 80th Avenue, Ocala</p>
					<p class="text-gray-200 text-sm">
						One of the world's largest equestrian facilities. We provide golf cart rentals for WEC events, making it easy to navigate the expansive grounds during horse shows, competitions, and events.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
